{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00111","headline":"幸秦始皇陵 · 中宗皇帝","name":"幸秦始皇陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"眷言君失德，骊邑想秦余。\n政烦方改篆，愚俗乃焚书。\n阿房久已灭，阁道遂成墟。\n欲厌东南气，翻伤掩鲍车。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"中宗皇帝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}